这杯咖啡已经开始发挥作用了
And the coffee's already working,

166
00:07:43,620 --> 00:07:44,980
因为我已经算出 现在是午夜
'cause I figured out if it's midnight now,

167
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:46,200
而我们得在明早10点交货
we have to be done at 10:00 A.M.

168
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:48,520
每一批小蛋糕从头到尾需要40分钟
so if it's 40 minutes per batch from beginning to end,

169
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,580
一次能做四打 也就是48个小蛋糕
baking 4 dozen at a time, that's 48 cupcakes

170
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,300
乘以20批 刚好花费9小时
Times 20 trips to the oven, which equals nine hours,

171
00:07:52,340 --> 00:07:53,260
就等于四千块入手
which equals $4,000.

172
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:56,940
快让我喝两口 看我能不能学会算数
Give me that. Let's see if I can do math too.

173
00:07:59,020 --> 00:07:59,900
出题考我吧
Ask me something.

174
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:01,660
16乘12
16 times 12.

175
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,740
我还是乖乖享受我的咖啡就好
I'm just going to enjoy my coffee.

176
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:06,080
你慢慢享用 我去预热烤箱
You enjoy, I'll preheat the oven.

177
00:08:06,220 --> 00:08:07,580
要几度 162摄氏度
What's the temp? 325.

178
00:08:08,300 --> 00:08:09,380
喝了咖啡 再也不担心数学
There, that's the coffee talking.

179
00:08:13,820 --> 00:08:16,620
安迪发了我一张鹿给乌龟喂奶的图
Andy just sent me a picture of a deer nursing a turtle.

180
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:18,880
这就是它们教导小乌龟
This is why they tell teen turtles

181
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:20,320
不要乱贴照片上脸书的原因
never to post up on facebook.

182
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:23,880
我都不知道你俩还在互发短信呢
Oh, I didn't realize you two were still texting.

183
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,820
我们通常都只是在互发
Well, we're mostly just sending pictures

184
00:08:25,820 --> 00:08:27,280
非比寻常的动物友情图而已
of unlikely animal friendships.

185
00:08:27,940 --> 00:08:29,400
你看 这张是熊跟兔子一起睡午觉
See, there's a bear napping with a bunny.

186
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:30,860
那这个呢
And what's this?

187
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:32,906
是拉布拉多德利犬跟锦鲤击掌
It's a labradoodle high-fiving a koi fish.

188
00:08:32,906 --> 00:08:34,760
不是挺明摆着的嘛
It's pretty self-explanatory.

189
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,600
不 是图下的字 这个
No, underneath that. This--

190
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:37,620
"卡洛琳还好吗"
"How's Caroline?"

191
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:40,320
不是只是"非比寻常动物友情图之友"吗
I thought this was just an unlikely animal friendship.

192
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,780
通常都是啊 但有些短信
It is, mostly, but every other text,

193
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:44,720
让我觉得他还没放下你呢
I get the idea that maybe he's not over you.

194
00:08:45,220 --> 00:08:47,100
是他甩了我好吗
He's the one who broke up with me.

195
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,540
可能他后悔呢
Well, maybe he regrets it.

196
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:52,100
你们可能就像克里斯小子与蕾哈娜啊
Maybe you two are like Chris Brown and Rihanna,

197
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,640
少了拳打脚踢与合唱版的
minus the punching and the duet.

198
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:56,620
其实我挺讶异的
I'm kind of surprised.

199
00:08:56,620 --> 00:08:57,940
我觉得你们俩很配呢
I thought you guys were good together.

200
00:08:58,780 --> 00:09:01,200
安迪很好 而平常呢
Andy is great. And on the surface,

201
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,900
他也总是守护我 支持我
he was there for me and very supportive.

202
00:09:02,900 --> 00:09:04,620
但后来他有点受不了
But then he kind of got fed up

203
00:09:04,620 --> 00:09:06,400
我太注重自己与事业的这件事
when it was so much about me and my career.

204
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:07,920
直到最后 悲剧发生
And when push came to shove,

205
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,640
他为了自己着想 觉得该放下这段感情
he felt like he had to pull away for his own well-being.

206
00:09:11,100 --> 00:09:13,440
天啊 我们还真是蕾哈娜与克里斯小子
Oh, my God, we are Rihanna and Chris Brown!

207
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:16,020
而我就是克里斯小子
But I'm Chris Brown.

208
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:18,980
说到克里斯小子
Speaking of Chris Brown,

209
00:09:19,180 --> 00:09:20,520
我要开始搅拌[痛打]啦
I'm gonna start to batter.

210
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:22,640
烤箱怎么样了
How's that stove?

211
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:25,300
温度上来了 但它好摇晃啊
Warm, but it's really wobbly.

212
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:27,040
它摇摇晃晃 又冒烟[抽烟]
Yeah, it wobbles, it smokes,

213
00:09:27,060 --> 00:09:28,280
有次还烫了我
and one time it burned me.

214
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,740
所以我给它的昵称是"老妈"
That's why I nicknamed it "mom."

215
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:32,440
烤箱脚下的那块木头是什么
What is this wood thing under the leg?

216
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:33,380
是垫木
It's the shim.

217
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:35,560
好像就是它让烤箱不稳的
I think it's making it worse.

218
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:37,580
别啊 那是来垫烤箱脚的
Don't! That's holding the leg up!

219
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:44,120
想必你现在明白它的作用了
But I guess you figured that out now.

220
00:09:44,460 --> 00:09:46,740
我不都说是垫木了吗
You heard me say it was the shim!

221
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:48,760
我哪知道什么是垫木啊
I don't know what a shim is.

222
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:51,120
我还以为又是个街头词汇之类的
I thought it was just one of those things you say.

223
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:52,640
那垫木还能是啥意思啊
What did you think it could be?

224
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:54,200
我还以为是混词之类的啊
I thought it was a cool word blend.

225
00:09:54,460 --> 00:09:57,200
称呼变性人用的"他与她"混合词[音似]
You know, like she/him for a transsexual--a shim.

226
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:01,660
你觉得有迷你变性人托着我们的炉子吗
You thought a tiny transsexual was holding up our stove?

227
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:04,020
没错 我累到真这么以为
Yes, Max, I'm that tired.

228
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:06,780
觉得有一个迷你变性人正托着我们的炉子
I thought a tiny transsexual was holding up our stove.

229
00:10:07,180 --> 00:10:10,000
这下悲剧了 我们家的烤箱也不够大
This is a disaster, and our oven at home's too small.

230
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,260
我们现在怎么办啊
What are we gonna do now?

231
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:14,260
太好了 你们还在
Oh, good, you're still here.

232
00:10:14,280 --> 00:10:16,220
大家不许走 我们今晚倒霉透了
Don't anybody leave. Our night just got worse.

233
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:17,900
别再靠近我了 超级淋病妹
Don't come any closer, super gonorrhea!

234
00:10:20,380 --> 00:10:23,220
对不起 我们为了翘班撒谎了
I'm sorry to say we lied to get off our shift.

235
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:25,540
但我们得在明天前烤出一千个小蛋糕
But we have to bake 1,000 cupcakes by tomorrow,

236
00:10:25,540 --> 00:10:28,040
但我们店里的烤箱坏了 得借用你的
and our oven broke at the shop, and we need to use yours.

237
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:30,060
你撒谎骗我 现在还要我帮忙啊
You lied to me, and now you want a favor?

238
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,700
是的 阿憨 我们请你帮这个大忙
Yes. Han, we know it's a big favor,

239
00:10:32,700 --> 00:10:34,320
在你眼中可能看起来显得更大
and it probably looks even bigger to you,

240
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:37,520
但我相信你会原谅我们的谎
but I'm sure you can see past our lie.

241
00:10:37,540 --> 00:10:39,460
如果你真不能原谅 那你就起立
And if you can't, you can get up on that chair,

242
00:10:39,460 --> 00:10:41,346
我让你坐上我肩头玩...
I could put you on our shoulders...

243
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:45,260
长话超短说 你愿意帮忙吗
Long story abnormally short, will you help us?

244
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:48,500
你那无数矮子嘲讽惹到我了
Well, those 12 short jokes really primed me.

245
00:10:49,340 --> 00:10:50,440
但好吧 你们用吧
Fine, you can use the oven

246
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,820
其他东西也都随你们用
and any of the supplies you need.

247
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:54,100
谢谢 小蛋糕真的非做成不可
Thank you. We really need to fill this order.

248
00:10:54,540 --> 00:10:55,500
我留下来帮手吧
I'll stay and help.

249
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:57,260
我也有些事得"做"
I also had something to fill,

250
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:59,640
但我还是短信苏菲说我在工作吧
but I'll just text Sophie and tell her I'm working.

251
00:11:01,500 --> 00:11:02,500
我也留下帮忙
I'll help too.

252
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:05,060
我不会烤东西 但坐着与鼓舞士气很在行
I can't bake, but I can sit and lift the spirits.

253
00:11:05,260 --> 00:11:06,580
只要能有酒[士气]喝就行了
as long as there are spirits.

254
00:11:06,580 --> 00:11:08,020
无限畅饮对吧 阿憨
It's open bar, right, Han?

255
00:11:09,580 --> 00:11:10,660
好吧 我也加入
Okay, I'm in too.

256
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:12,100
厄尔 给我来个海风鸡尾酒
Earl, make me a sea breeze,

257
00:11:12,260 --> 00:11:13,240
微风就好别太烈
easy on the breezy.

258
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:16,160
由于我的儿时阴影
You know, because of my childhood,

259
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:17,740
我对你们现在
I won't be able to process the fact

260
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:19,340
留下来帮手的好心举动反应无能
that you've all just done something nice for me,

261
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:22,040
所以如果十年后 我遇见你们时突然大哭
So if I run into you in ten years and start crying,

262
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,160
哭的就是现在这一刻
this is what it's about.

263
00:11:30,836 --> 00:11:33,100
九百个小蛋糕 新鲜出炉
900 and counting. Comin' through.

264
00:11:33,100 --> 00:11:33,920
你想让我放哪
Where do you want them?

265
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:36,320
这里 就放在史上动作最慢的帮手旁边
Put 'em over here, next to the world's slowest helper.

266
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:39,540
你裱一个小蛋糕的花比
It took you longer to make that one cupcake

267
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:41,420
詹姆斯·卡梅隆拍一部《阿凡达》还慢
than it took James Cameron to make Avatar.

268
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:45,720
这活我干了两分钟
Well, I been doing this for two minutes,

269
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,480
不得不说...
and I have to say...

270
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:49,300
不适合我
not for me.

271
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:53,160
你知道我适合干什么吗
But you know what is for me?

272
00:11:53,260 --> 00:11:54,820
再"干"一杯免费白兰地
Another free cognac.

273
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:57,160
准备好再来一杯海风了吗 小憨憨
Ready for another sea breeze, Han?

274
00:11:57,700 --> 00:11:59,360
等我弄好了再说
Not before I get this right.

275
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:01,520
而且你不会想看到我两杯海风下肚后的样子
And you don't want to see me on two sea breezes.

276
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,660
会怎么样 你会变成"林赛·蠢憨"吗
What happens, you become Lindsay Lo-Han?

277
00:12:06,980 --> 00:12:08,640
好吧 让我来教你怎么做
Okay, let me show you how it's done.

278
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:12,340
这样 感觉到了吗 阿憨
There, you feel how that is, Han?

279
00:12:12,446 --> 00:12:15,129
-有吧 -好的
- Uh, yes. - Ok.

280
00:12:15,740 --> 00:12:17,380
现在用力挤那袋"奶油"
Now just squeeze that bag.

281
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,380
很好 再用力点
Good. Little harder.

282
00:12:19,860 --> 00:12:21,180
很好 再用力点
Good. Little harder.

283
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,040
丢死人了
I'm humiliated.

284
00:12:30,666 --> 00:12:31,760
没关系啦 阿憨
It's okay, Han,

285
00:12:31,760 --> 00:12:33,440
很多男人第一次都会这样
it happens to a lot of guys their first time.

286
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:37,260
赶紧像别人那样 拿张纸巾
Get yourself a tissue and clean yourself off,

287
00:12:37,260 --> 00:12:38,320
擦擦干净
like everyone else.

288
00:12:40,260 --> 00:12:41,040
阿憨 这活你不用干了
Han, you're off the bag.

289
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:41,900
我要派你去搅面粉
I'm moving you to batter.

290
00:12:42,260 --> 00:12:44,080
这不是降职 只是你裱花太烂
It's not a demotion, it's just that you stink at this.

291
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,180
我想让你去干点容易的
I wanna give you something easier.

292
00:12:46,100 --> 00:12:48,160
麦克斯 你的围裙弄脏了
Max, you just got that all over your apron.

293
00:12:48,580 --> 00:12:50,340
我来帮你擦干净 我的也脏了
I'll wipe it down. Mine's a mess too.

294
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,480
哇 动作真熟练
Ooh, pretty slick move.

295
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:53,720
下次想试试脱我的胸罩吗
You wanna try for my bra next?

296
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:56,960
好啊 宝贝
Yeah, baby,

297
00:12:57,140 --> 00:12:58,580
我来帮你脱胸罩
I'll take off your bra.

298
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:03,140
那声音是怎么回事
What the hell was that?

299
00:13:03,860 --> 00:13:05,480
怎么了 那是我的男声啊
What? It's my guy voice.

300
00:13:06,700 --> 00:13:08,520
你学男声就是这样啊
That's your go-to guy voice?

301
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:11,100
日界线新闻节目有保护你这变态的身份吗
Is his identity being protected on Dateline?

302
00:13:12,500 --> 00:13:14,460
那你的男声是什么样
Well, what's your guy voice like?

303
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,000
就现在这样啊
I'm doing it right now.

304
00:13:21,020 --> 00:13:22,700
我要快快地去尿个尿
I'm gonna take a quick pee break.

305
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:25,420
不知道 或许是你调的酒酒劲太强了
I don't know, I think you might be making the drinks too strong.

306
00:13:26,020 --> 00:13:28,220
我们没有醉 奥列格 只是神志模糊而已
We're not drunk, Oleg, just punchy.

307
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:30,040
我单纯是喝醉了
I'm just drunk.

308
00:13:35,780 --> 00:13:38,820
大家能留下来陪我们到这么晚 真好
It was so nice of everyone to stay that long.

309
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,459
除了这些 其他的都烤好了
Everything's baked except for those.

310
00:13:40,459 --> 00:13:42,419
我们能搞定的 麦克斯
We've gonna make it, Max.

311
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:46,700
安迪发给我一张猫咪和海豚的接吻照
Andy sent me a cat and a dolphin kissing.

312
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:49,220
希望它们不只接吻 我好想看它们爱的结晶
I hope they go all the way. I'm dying to see their baby.

313
00:13:49,220 --> 00:13:51,496
猫豚 棒呆了
A cat-dolphin? Yes!

314
00:13:52,580 --> 00:13:54,080
我觉得这样不好吧
I don't think that's healthy.

315
00:13:54,540 --> 00:13:55,420
如果真的相爱
Well, if they're in love,

316
00:13:55,420 --> 00:13:56,380
那关你屁事啊
it's really none of your business.

317
00:13:57,540 --> 00:13:59,880
为什么大半夜你还给他发短信啊
Why are you texting him in the middle of the night?

318
00:14:00,500 --> 00:14:01,980
老实说 为什么他还没睡
In fact, why is he still up?

319
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,100
他是不是在打听我啊
Is he talking about me?

320
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:04,280
你看起来不爽
You look upset.

321
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,540
你要我别跟他发短信吗
Do you want me to stop texting him?

322
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,040
不用 没关系
No. It's fine.

323
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:09,240
只是我累了 活也差不多干完了
It's just I'm tired and we're almost finished,

324
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,360
我现在只想回家
and I just wanna go home.

325
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:12,500
收到 我热死了
Got it. I'm so hot.

326
00:14:12,540 --> 00:14:14,080
等我先把头发扎起来
Let me just get this hair off my neck.

327
00:14:15,780 --> 00:14:17,340
麦克斯 为什么你今天只戴一只耳环
Max, why are you wearing only one earring?

328
00:14:17,560 --> 00:14:18,820
你瞎说什么 我明明戴的是两只
What are you talking about? I'm wearing two.

329
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:20,940
奇了怪了
That's weird.

330
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:23,180
还有一只呢 是不是在我头发里
Where is it? Is it in my hair?

331
00:14:24,060 --> 00:14:25,600
没有啊 是不是掉下来了
No, no. Did it fall down?

332
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:26,660
快检查下你的咪咪
Yeah, check your boobs.

333
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:27,700
上次遥控器就是在那发现的
That's where you found the remote.

334
00:14:29,622 --> 00:14:31,865
不在 不在我身上
It's not-it's not anywhere on me.

335
00:14:31,865 --> 00:14:33,580
你最后一次看见它是什么时候
Well, when's the last time you saw it?

336
00:14:33,580 --> 00:14:35,380
我不知道 但肯定在这附近
I don't know, but it couldn't have gone far.

337
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,300
我几乎一整晚都在这里
I was in this area pretty much the whole night.

338
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,340
你是说在面粉糊上方吗
You mean over the batter?

339
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,941
-没有 没有 -没发现 没发现
- No, no, no. - Nothing, nothing, nothing!

340
00:14:43,941 --> 00:14:45,734
-没有 没有 -没发现 没发现
- No, no, no, no. - Nothing, nothing, nothing!

341
00:14:45,734 --> 00:14:47,340
-没有 没有 -没发现 没发现
- No, no, no, no, no! - Nothing, nothing, no!

342
00:14:47,340 --> 00:14:49,320
不在这里 那就意味着
It's not here, which means

343
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:51,320
那只耳环在其中一个做好的小蛋糕里
it's in one of those already-baked cupcakes.

344
00:14:51,860 --> 00:14:54,080
来吧 我们得开始逐个掰开找
Let's go. We have to start pulling these apart.

345
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:57,079
来真的啊 拜托 别小题大作嘛
Really? Come on, don't be ridiculous.

346
00:14:57,079 --> 00:15:00,040
最坏的情况不过也是 在一千个小蛋糕中
Look, worst-case scenario, one of the 1,000 cupcakes

347
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:01,000
有一个里面有只耳环
has an earring in it.

348
00:15:01,340 --> 00:15:02,300
跟客人说是惊喜礼物就好啦
We'll tell them it's a surprise.

349
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:06,400
不行 最坏的情况是有人吃到那个小蛋糕
No, the worst-case scenario is someone bites into it,

350
00:15:06,420 --> 00:15:08,520
把嘴唇弄破了 然后把我们告上法庭
rips their lip open, and sues us.

351
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:10,780
随便他们告 反正我们没钱赔
Let them sue us. We don't have any money.

352
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,500
所以我们就会进监狱
And that's why we'll go to jail.

353
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:14,200
没错 我会被关进大牢
Yep, I'll be locked up raw

354
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:15,660
然后被迫做别人的女玩物
and forced to be someone's girlfriend.

355
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:17,340
我在监狱外已经是个坏女友了
I mean, I'm a bad girlfriend out of prison.

356
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:19,140
跟监狱大姐大在一起 能好过吗
It's not gonna be any easier with big joan.

357
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:20,460
淡定
Calm down.

358
00:15:20,780 --> 00:15:22,680
如果我们进监狱 我来做你的女友
If we go to prison, I'll be your girlfriend.

359
00:15:23,020 --> 00:15:24,560
直到有更性感的妞进来取代我
Until someone hotter comes along,

360
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:25,600
监狱里都是这样
'cause that's the way it goes in prison.

361
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:27,380
开始找吧
Start looking.

362
00:15:27,380 --> 00:15:30,800
我才不要捏烂我辛苦做的九百个小蛋糕
I am not going to smash 900 cupcakes.

363
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:32,320
那我们只好全部重做啦
Then we'll just have to start over.

364
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:35,500
不要 我宁愿搭个顺风车去西部
Oh, no, I would rather hitch a ride west

365
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:36,120
然后跟别的女人共事一夫
and become a sister-wife.

366
00:15:39,980 --> 00:15:42,280
这太疯狂了 就不能发短信
This is crazy. Can't I just text them

367
00:15:42,280 --> 00:15:43,660
告诉他们 这活我们干不了吗
and tell them we can't do the job?

368
00:15:43,760 --> 00:15:46,000
不 你不能这样做 我们需要这笔钱
No, you can't text them. We need the money.

369
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:47,960
别老发什么破短信了
And stop with all the texting.

370
00:15:48,060 --> 00:15:49,460
或许如果你不是整天想着
Maybe if you were thinking less about

371
00:15:49,460 --> 00:15:50,240
跟我的前男友发短信
texting with my ex-boyfriend,

372
00:15:50,980 --> 00:15:53,260
你就不会弄丢你的耳环
you wouldn't have lost your earring in the first place.

373
00:15:53,620 --> 00:15:55,220
这话你早就该说了
You should have just said it.

374
00:15:55,220 --> 00:15:57,460
你不爽我跟安迪发短信
You have a problem with me texting Andy.

375
00:15:57,540 --> 00:15:59,440
我才没有不爽
I do not have a problem with it!

376
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:01,860
很好 因为他也是我的朋友
Oh, good, 'cause he's my friend too.

377
00:16:02,680 --> 00:16:04,500
你不觉得你对最好朋友
You'd think your loyalty to your best friend

378
00:16:04,500 --> 00:16:06,220
和生意伙伴的忠诚度要比
and business partner would be more important

379
00:16:06,220 --> 00:16:08,120
那些白痴的动物友情重要得多吗
than some stupid animal friendship!

380
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:09,840
我是说...
I mean...

381
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:11,820
我真吃惊这种话得我亲自说出口 麦克斯
I'm surprised I even have to tell you that, Max.

382
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:12,920
这可是"闺蜜法则"
It's kind of girl code.

383
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:16,900
老娘太累 不想听什么狗屁"闺蜜法则"
Oh, I am way to tired to hear "girl code."

384
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:17,860
别说了
Shut it down.

385
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:21,920
闺蜜法则 麦克斯
Girl code, Max.

386
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,440
闺蜜法则
Girl code.

387
00:16:25,100 --> 00:16:27,000
闭嘴 卡洛琳
Shut up, Caroline.

388
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,520
闭嘴
Shut up!

389
00:16:30,100 --> 00:16:32,560
我都不屑于对此做出反应了
I'm not even gonna dignify that with a response.

390
00:16:32,820 --> 00:16:34,480
没错 这就是我的目的 贱人
Yeah, that was the goal, bitch.

391
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:37,180
我没空跟你吵架
I don't have time for this.

392
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:39,120
我得在这一千个小蛋糕里
I have to find an earring that you lost

393
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:41,320
找出你不见的那只耳环 贱人
in one of these thousand cupcakes, bitch!

394
00:16:42,180 --> 00:16:46,480
是你忘记告诉我要做这一千个小蛋糕
The thousand cupcakes that you forgot to tell me about!

395
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:49,300
闺蜜法则就是说 当你的闺蜜
And the girl code means that when a girl

396
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:50,460
跟别人分手时
breaks up with someone,

397
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:52,220
你不会跟她们的男友搅和在一起
you don't interfere with their boyfriend,

398
00:16:52,220 --> 00:16:54,320
因为你的闺蜜想跟他保持距离
because she needs some distance.

399
00:16:54,620 --> 00:16:56,580
那你为什么不在14小时前
Well, why didn't you tell me that

400
00:16:56,580 --> 00:16:58,840
我问你的时候告诉我
When I asked you 14 hours ago?

401
00:17:01,780 --> 00:17:04,000
麦克斯 我收到你的短信
Hey, Max. I got your text.

402
00:17:04,340 --> 00:17:04,980
我是来帮忙的
I'm here to help.

403
00:17:06,740 --> 00:17:09,620
那条是在闺蜜法则出现前发的
Um, that was a pre-girl-code text.

404
00:17:11,080 --> 00:17:12,880
在厄尔醉倒 我把小憨憨弄哭后
I thought we maybe needed a backup

405
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:14,860
我觉得我们可能需要个后备帮手
after Earl passed out and I made Han cry.

406
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:24,720
安迪 在我人生中内疚之事的榜单里
Andy, on the list of things I feel guilty about in life,

407
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:26,340
半夜叫你来帮忙这件事
calling you to help in the middle of the night

408
00:17:26,340 --> 00:17:27,080
排名第二
is number two.

409
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:28,320
本来能荣登榜首
It would be number one

410
00:17:28,320 --> 00:17:29,800
但榜首是那个我因为想更早进入
if I hadn't pushed that girl down the stairs

411
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:31,980
98度乐队的音乐会 而被我推下楼梯的女生
to get into the 98 degrees concert before her.

412
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,320
那可是98度啊
Well, it was 98 degrees.

413
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,280
人必需得死啊
People had to die.

414
00:17:37,740 --> 00:17:39,080
好了 别装没事开玩笑了
Okay, let's stop all this joking

415
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:40,540
认真说说我来这里的真正原因吧
and get down to why I really came here.

416
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:42,020
求你了 卡洛琳 爱我吧
Come on, Caroline, love me.

417
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:45,140
你刚是说 "卡洛琳 爱我吧"吗
Did you just say, "Caroline, love me"?

418
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:47,380
不 我是说 "卡洛琳 套我吧"
No, I said, "Caroline, glove me."

419
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:49,660
要多卑微才会求人说 "爱我吧"
what kind of loser would say, "Love me"?

420
00:17:50,580 --> 00:17:51,640
除非你真爱我
Unless you do.

421
00:17:55,460 --> 00:17:56,300
你过得怎么样
So how you doing?

422
00:17:57,180 --> 00:17:57,860
还行
I'm okay.

423
00:17:58,640 --> 00:17:59,560
就是有点累
A little tired.

424
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:03,020
我最近常常想起你
You know, I've been thinking about you a lot.

425
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:05,400
自从我们分手后 我一直在想你
Pretty much all the time since we broke up.

426
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:08,140
或许我对你沉迷于工作
Um, maybe I overreacted to your whole

427
00:18:08,140 --> 00:18:09,720
这件事有点反应过激
obsession with work thing, you know?

428
00:18:10,780 --> 00:18:12,149
你之所以凌晨4点还在这里
Well, you are here at 4:00 A.M.

429
00:18:12,149 --> 00:18:15,460
是因为我得在4小时内做出一千个小蛋糕
'cause I needed help making 1,000 cupcakes in four hours.

430
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:17,120
或许有人会称其为"沉迷"
One might call that obsessive.

431
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:18,540
有人会
One might.

432
00:18:18,900 --> 00:18:19,900
又或者人人都会这么说
Or pretty much everyone might.

433
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:22,380
安迪
And, Andy,

434
00:18:22,860 --> 00:18:25,280
即使深知我们之间不可能了
just know that even though it didn't work out,

435
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:29,020
但我真的"套"你
I do glove you.

436
00:18:29,940 --> 00:18:31,020
我也"套"你
I glove you too.

437
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:34,540
现在赶紧在烤糊之前 把小蛋糕都拿出来
Now, get the cupcakes out before they burn.

438
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:36,120
我没有精力再重做一遍
I don't have the energy to do this all again.

439
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:37,940
我甩了的工作狂女友现身了
Ah, there's the girl I broke up with.

440
00:18:39,580 --> 00:18:40,920
外面一切东西都准备好了
Everything's ready to go out there.

441
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:43,160
我的手今晚进过的箱子
I've had my hands in more boxes tonight

442
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:45,020
比免费诊所妇科医生的手进过的阴道还多
than a gynecologist at a free clinic.

443
00:18:50,360 --> 00:18:51,500
没这么好笑吧
It's not that funny.

444
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:54,060
等你27个小时不睡觉
Stay up another 27 hours,

445
00:18:54,140 --> 00:18:56,180
这会是你这辈子听过最好笑的一句话
it'll be the funniest damn thing you ever heard.

446
00:18:58,780 --> 00:19:00,280
都结束了
Well, that's the end of it.

447
00:19:00,540 --> 00:19:02,140
是啊 结束了
Yeah, I think it is.

448
00:19:02,900 --> 00:19:04,440
麦克斯 我说的不只是小蛋糕
Max, I'm talking about more than the cupcakes.

449
00:19:04,980 --> 00:19:07,040
是啊 我能从你布莱德利·库珀式的音调里听出
Yeah, I could tell by your Bradley Cooper tone.

450
00:19:08,100 --> 00:19:09,820
怎么了 你们俩彻底不可能了吗
So what, it's not gonna work out between you two?

451
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:10,600
是啊
No.

452
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:12,280
我觉得我们必须分手
And I think we have to break up.

453
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:13,760
我以为你俩早就分了啊
I thought you already broke up.

454
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,420
不 我是在说我和你
No, I'm talking about you and me.

455
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,200
你要甩了我啊
You're dumping me?

456
00:19:17,780 --> 00:19:19,120
上一个甩我的男人
Wow, last guy who dumped me,

457
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:20,440
我把他的房子烧了 然后搬走
I burned down his house and moved.

458
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:23,020
还想继续这个话题吗
Still wanna continue this conversation?

459
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:24,960
麦克斯 这样不行
Max, it wouldn't work.

460
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:26,900
我会一直跟你打听卡洛琳
I would always be asking you about Caroline.

461
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:28,560
我明白 这样很奇怪
Look, I get it, it's weird.

462
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:31,080
人们一般不会跟自己朋友的前任成为朋友
People don't usually stay friends with their friend's ex,

463
00:19:31,080 --> 00:19:35,040
可是猫咪一般也不会跟海豚成为朋友啊
But then, cats don't usually become friends with dolphins.

464
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:37,920
可有时 缘分就是这么奇妙
But sometimes, for no apparent reason, it happens.

465
00:19:38,660 --> 00:19:40,400
是啊 我只希望我跟
Yeah, I just wish I was as grown up

466
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:41,400
猫或海豚一样成熟
as a cat or a dolphin.

467
00:19:41,969 --> 00:19:44,100
我懂你意思
I hear ya.

468
00:19:44,100 --> 00:19:45,520
那接下来是什么 分手短信吗
So what's next, breakup text?

469
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:48,040
不要 发了之后就会有复合短信
Nah, that's just gonna lead to makeup text,

470
00:19:48,040 --> 00:19:49,380
然后我们就这么恶性循环下去
and then we're back in a vicious cycle.

471
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:52,440
好吧 那我只好去你家一趟
All right, I'll just stop by your place,

472
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:53,460
拿回我的CD和T恤
pick up my cds, my t-shirts,

473
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:55,080
还有留在你家的三千块
and the 3 grand I left there.

474
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:56,720
麦克斯 你从来没去过我家
Max, you've never been to my place.

475
00:19:57,080 --> 00:19:58,940
瞧 这就是我要跟你分手的原因
See, this is why I'm breaking up with you--

476
00:19:58,940 --> 00:19:59,680
你个骗子
You're a liar.

477
00:20:01,060 --> 00:20:03,140
索赔法院见 伙计
See you in small claims court, bub.

478
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:08,000
我们做到了 麦克斯
Well, we did it, Max.

479
00:20:08,060 --> 00:20:09,780
我们赚到了4千块
We made $4,000.

480
00:20:10,740 --> 00:20:12,540
关于我和安迪
And as far as Andy and I go,

481
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:14,040
我觉得我们像现在这样正好
I think we're in the right place,

482
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:15,960
因为当他说他分手后
because when he said he'd been thinking about me

483
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:16,720
每分每秒都在想我
since the breakup,

484
00:20:16,780 --> 00:20:19,340
我才意识到自己每分每秒想的都是小蛋糕
I realized I'd only been thinking about the cupcakes.

485
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:21,040
天啊 拜托把嘴闭上
Oh, please, god, shut up.

486
00:20:22,460 --> 00:20:24,440
谢谢 我的嘴也超级想休息
Thank you. I was dying to shut up.

487
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:30,100
是顾客发来的短信
Look, it's a text from the place.

488
00:20:30,100 --> 00:20:31,620
他们很喜欢我们的小蛋糕
They loved the cupcakes.

489
00:20:32,820 --> 00:20:34,460
慢着 为什么你的手机会在我的围裙里
Wait, why do I have your phone in my apron?

490
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:36,540
不可能 我的手机是放在我的围裙里
No, my phone was in my apron.

491
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:39,820
除非我当时擦完围裙后
Unless I handed you the wrong apron

492
00:20:39,820 --> 00:20:41,220
错把我的递给你了
after I wiped them down.

493
00:20:42,400 --> 00:20:42,880
什么
What?

494
00:20:44,340 --> 00:20:44,833
果然
What?

495
00:20:44,833 --> 00:20:48,420
你的耳环
Oh...Your earring.

496
00:20:48,420 --> 00:20:50,458
它一直在我这里
I had it in there the whole time.

497
00:20:50,458 --> 00:20:52,380
我们俩白痴
Oh, we're idiots!

498
00:20:52,380 --> 00:20:54,500
虽说是两种完全不同类型的白痴
We're two very different kinds of idiots,

499
00:20:54,560 --> 00:20:55,720
但我们都是白痴
but we're idiots.

500
00:20:56,460 --> 00:20:58,080
然而不知何故 我们俩超搭
And yet, somehow we work.

501
00:20:58,080 --> 00:21:00,340
我们就像非比寻常的动物朋友
We're the most unlikely animal friends.

502
00:21:00,920 --> 00:21:02,960
我是不知道啦 但我给你喂奶的照片
I don't know about that, but a picture of me nursing you

503
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:04,080
绝对会在网络上爆红
would definitely go viral.

504
00:21:05,620 --> 00:21:07,060
-晚安 -晚安
- Good night. - Good night.

505
00:21:08,020 --> 00:21:08,840
你要去哪里
Where you going?

506
00:21:09,220 --> 00:21:10,660
我累得没力气把床弄下来了
I'm too tired to pull my bed down.

507
00:21:10,740 --> 00:21:11,540
我要跟你一起睡
I'm sleeping with you.

508
00:21:11,840 --> 00:21:13,460
不行 你可是有超级淋病
No, you're not. You have super gonorrhea.
